/T (The methodology used for this report involved a comprehensive approach to analyzing phishing emails. We employed tools such as Google Header Analyzer and MxToolbox to analyze email headers for authentication protocols like SPF, DKIM, and DMARC. Each email was scrutinized not only for technical indicators but also through a manual review of sender domains and content to identify potential social engineering tactics. This dual strategy helps ensure a thorough understanding of the email's legitimacy.)
/E (The methodology used for this report involved a comprehensive approach to analyzing phishing emails. We employed tools such as Google Header Analyzer and MxToolbox to analyze email headers for authentication protocols like SPF, DKIM, and DMARC. Each email was scrutinized not only for technical indicators but also through a manual review of sender domains and content to identify potential social engineering tactics. This dual strategy helps ensure a thorough understanding of the email's legitimacy.)
