/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 68 0 R
/T (In addition to the technical analysis, the report emphasizes careful content review. This involves looking for red flags such as mismatched sender addresses, suspicious links, and manipulative language designed to create urgency. Each email was categorized based on its risk level: Safe, Suspicious, or Phishing. This comprehensive methodology is essential for effective phishing detection and awareness, allowing organizations to better protect themselves from evolving threats in the digital landscape.)
/E (In addition to the technical analysis, the report emphasizes careful content review. This involves looking for red flags such as mismatched sender addresses, suspicious links, and manipulative language designed to create urgency. Each email was categorized based on its risk level: Safe, Suspicious, or Phishing. This comprehensive methodology is essential for effective phishing detection and awareness, allowing organizations to better protect themselves from evolving threats in the digital landscape.)
