/T (The Prevention and Awareness Guidelines are essential for recognizing and mitigating phishing threats. Always verify the sender's actual email domain instead of relying on the display name. Hovering over links before clicking allows you to see the real destination. It's crucial to check header authentication results such as SPF, DKIM, and DMARC using tools like Google Header Analyzer or MxToolbox when in doubt. If an email claims urgent action, contact the organization directly through a known official channel to confirm its authenticity.)
/E (The Prevention and Awareness Guidelines are essential for recognizing and mitigating phishing threats. Always verify the sender's actual email domain instead of relying on the display name. Hovering over links before clicking allows you to see the real destination. It's crucial to check header authentication results such as SPF, DKIM, and DMARC using tools like Google Header Analyzer or MxToolbox when in doubt. If an email claims urgent action, contact the organization directly through a known official channel to confirm its authenticity.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
