/P 74 0 R
/T (To effectively combat phishing threats, it's crucial to avoid certain common pitfalls. Don't trust an email solely because it has passed SPF, DKIM, or DMARC checks; these can be manipulated by anyone using free platforms. Moreover, never click on links or open attachments from unexpected emails, even if they appear to come from familiar senders. Additionally, avoid replying to spam to unsubscribe unless you're certain the source is legitimate, as this can confirm your address is active and lead to more unsolicited emails.)
/E (To effectively combat phishing threats, it's crucial to avoid certain common pitfalls. Don't trust an email solely because it has passed SPF, DKIM, or DMARC checks; these can be manipulated by anyone using free platforms. Moreover, never click on links or open attachments from unexpected emails, even if they appear to come from familiar senders. Additionally, avoid replying to spam to unsubscribe unless you're certain the source is legitimate, as this can confirm your address is active and lead to more unsolicited emails.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
