515 0 obj
<<
/Title (The methodology used for this report involved a comprehensive approach to analyzing phishing emails. We employed tools such as Google Header Analyzer and MxToolbox to analyze email headers for authentication protocols like SPF, DKIM, and DMARC. Each email was scrutinized not only for technical indicators but also through a manual review of sender domains and content to identify potential social engineering tactics. This dual strategy helps ensure a thorough understanding of the email's legitimacy.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 463 0 R
/Next 516 0 R
>>
endobj
516 0 obj
<<
/Title (In addition to the technical analysis, the report emphasizes careful content review. This involves looking for red flags such as mismatched sender addresses, suspicious links, and manipulative language designed to create urgency. Each email was categorized based on its risk level: Safe, Suspicious, or Phishing. This comprehensive methodology is essential for effective phishing detection and awareness, allowing organizations to better protect themselves from evolving threats in the digital landscape.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 463 0 R
/Prev 515 0 R
>>
endobj
